    "description": {
      "value": "This potent poison consists of crystals whose flavor and appearance mimics edible salt but whose effects are deadly; victims experience periods of waking nightmares that overload the senses and eventually result in death through a combination of shock and exhaustion.\n\nDC: 43\nSaving Throw: Fortitude\nMaximum Duration: 5 days\nOnset: 1 hour\n- Stage 1: frightened 2 once every 1d4 hours, plus fatigued (1 day)\n- Stage 2: confused for 1 minute once every 1d4 hours, plus frightened 3 and fatigued (1 day)\n- Stage 3: frightened 3, plus confused for 1d4 minutes, once every hour, plus fatigued (1 day)\n- Stage 4: death\n\nActivate (1 Action); Components Interact"
